epository_network_root_nwo\\\": \\\"letta-ai/letta\\\",\\n              \\\"og:author:username\\\": \\\"Jonathan-Harker\\\",\\n              \\\"theme-color\\\": \\\"#1e2327\\\",\\n              \\\"analytics-location\\\": \\\"/<user-name>/<repo-name>/voltron/issues_fragments/issue_layout\\\",\\n              \\\"viewport\\\": \\\"width=device-width\\\",\\n              \\\"twitter:site\\\": \\\"@github\\\",\\n              \\\"octolytics-dimension-user_id\\\": \\\"177780362\\\",\\n              \\\"expected-hostname\\\": \\\"github.com\\\",\\n              \\\"github-keyboard-shortcuts\\\": \\\"repository,issues,copilot\\\",\\n              \\\"ogUrl\\\": \\\"https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2521\\\",\\n              \\\"og:image:height\\\": \\\"600\\\",\\n              \\\"scrapeId\\\": \\\"6060b368-31fa-4190-96b4-0bfa2f14c503\\\",\\n              \\\"sourceURL\\\": \\\"https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2521\\\",\\n              \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2521\\\",\\n              \\\"statusCode\\\": 200,\\n              \\\"contentType\\\": \\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\\",\\n              \\\"proxyUsed\\\": \\\"basic\\\",\\n              \\\"cacheState\\\": \\\"miss\\\"\\n            }\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\\"Letta Test Connection button fails on new agent connection\\\": {\\n      \\\"query\\\": \\\"Letta Test Connection button fails on new agent connection\\\",\\n      \\\"question\\\": \\\"What should be done if connecting a Remote MCP server to a new agent fails after pressing the Test Connection button?\\\",\\n      \\\"raw_results\\\": {\\n        \\\"success\\\": true,\\n        \\\"data\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"title\\\": \\\"Unable to create an agent in the ADE #2212 - letta-ai/letta - GitHub\\\",\\n            \\\"description\\\": \\\"Describe the bug from localhost:8283/agents ; click on the \\\\\\\"+ Create Agent\\\\\\\" button, The \\\\\\\"Create Agent\\\\\\\" modal pops up, make any changes you ...\\\",\\n            \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212\\\",\\n            \\\"markdown\\\": \\\"[Skip to content](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212#start-of-content)\\\\n\\\\n[letta-ai](https://github.com/letta-ai)/ **[letta](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta)** Public\\\\n\\\\n- [Notifications](https://github.com/login?return_to=%2Fletta-ai%2Fletta) You must be signed in to change notification settings\\\\n- [Fork\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n1.9k](https://github.com/login?return_to=%2Fletta-ai%2Fletta)\\\\n- [Star\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n17.7k](https://github.com/login?return_to=%2Fletta-ai%2Fletta)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n# Unable to create an agent in the ADE\\\\\\\\#2212\\\\n\\\\n[New issue](https://github.com/login?return_to=https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212)\\\\n\\\\nCopy link\\\\n\\\\n[New issue](https://github.com/login?return_to=https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212)\\\\n\\\\nCopy link\\\\n\\\\nNot planned\\\\n\\\\nNot planned\\\\n\\\\n[Unable to create an agent in the ADE](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212#top)#2212\\\\n\\\\nCopy link\\\\n\\\\n[![@T-ravis-H](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169403510?u=12ba200abbe61ad835b53b37346ca2bc69c14bf8&v=4&size=80)](https://github.com/T-ravis-H)\\\\n\\\\n## Description\\\\n\\\\n[![@T-ravis-H](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169403510?u=12ba200abbe61ad835b53b37346ca2bc69c14bf8&v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/T-ravis-H)\\\\n\\\\n[T-ravis-H](https://github.com/T-ravis-H)\\\\n\\\\nopened [on Dec 10, 2024](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212#issue-2730616748)\\\\n\\\\nIssue body actions\\\\n\\\\n**Describe the bug**\\\\n\\\\nfrom localhost:8283/agents ; click on the \\\\\\\"+ Create Agent\\\\\\\" button, The \\\\\\\"Create Agent\\\\\\\" modal pops up, make any changes you want (that are valid (i.e., the agent name must be 2 characters, fill in all the fields, model, embedding Config, select template for Agent and human, click create nothing displays in the browser, I see a 422 thrown \\\\\\\"INFO: ::1:62369 - \\\\\\\"POST /v1/agents/ HTTP/1.1\\\\\\\" 422 Unprocessable Entity\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nMy cursor AI says this about the error\\\\n\\\\n\\\\\\\"The issue is that the ADE web app is using an outdated API schema. The agent creation endpoint has changed:\\\\n\\\\n1. It now requires a memory\\\\\\\\_blocks field\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nThe old memory field structure is no longer accepted\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nLooking at the server code earlier, I can see that the memory system has been refactored to use a block-based approach. This is why we're seeing those warnings in the server log about duplicate operation IDs for memory block operations.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nTo fix this, you have a few options:\\\\n2. Update the ADE web app code to use the new API schema\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Please describe your setup**\\\\n\\\\n- How did you install letta?\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n- `pip install letta` into a .venv in my codebase\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nTo pick up a draggable item, press the space bar.\\\\nWhile dragging, use the arrow keys to move the item.\\\\nPress space again to drop the item in its new position, or press escape to cancel.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n- Describe your setup\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n- What's your OS Win11\\\\n\\\\n- How are you running `letta` cmd: letta server --debug\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nTo pick up a draggable item, press the space bar.\\\\nWhile dragging, use the arrow keys to move the item.\\\\nPress space again to drop the item in its new position, or press escape to cancel.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nTo pick up a draggable item, press the space bar.\\\\nWhile dragging, use the arrow keys to move the item.\\\\nPress space again to drop the item in its new position, or press escape to cancel.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n**Screenshots**\\\\n\\\\nIf applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.\\\\n\\\\n**Additional context**\\\\n\\\\nAdd any other context about the problem here.\\\\n\\\\n**Letta Config**\\\\n\\\\nv0.6.1\\\\n\\\\n* * *\\\\n\\\\nUsing OpenAI various models\\\\n\\\\n## Activity\\\\n\\\\n[![cpacker](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5475622?u=d5b68b5396a75cb55e2d45afae51e348bc1686c9&v=4&size=80)](https://github.com/cpacker)\\\\n\\\\n### cpacker commented on Dec 10, 2024\\\\n\\\\n[![@cpacker](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5475622?u=d5b68b5396a75cb55e2d45afae51e348bc1686c9&v=4&size=48)](https://github.com/cpacker)\\\\n\\\\n[cpacker](https://github.com/cpacker)\\\\n\\\\n[on Dec 10, 2024](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212#issuecomment-2532521396)\\\\n\\\\nCollaborator\\\\n\\\\nHi [@T-ravis-H](https://github.com/T-ravis-H) ,\\\\n\\\\nThe old ADE is no longer supported beyond Letta version `0.5.0` (as you correctly noted, the APIs changed and the old ADE was not updated to the new API schema).\\\\n\\\\nThe new ADE that is under active development is available [here](https://app.letta.com/). That one is fully up-to-date with the API schemas and can connect to your localhost (you can even configure it to connect to multiple Letta server instances behind static IPs).\\\\n\\\\n[![](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5475622?s=64&u=d5b68b5396a75cb55e2d45afae51e348bc1686c9&v=4)cpacker](https://github.com/cpacker)\\\\n\\\\nclosed this as [not planned](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20state%3Aclosed%20archived%3Afalse%20reason%3Anot-planned) [on Dec 10, 2024](https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212#event-15605354057)\\\\n\\\\n[Sign up for free](https://github.com/signup?return_to=https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212)**to join this conversation on GitHub.** Already have an account? [Sign in to comment](https://github.com/login?return_to=https://github.com/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212)\\\\n\\\\n## Metadata\\\\n\\\\n## Metadata\\\\n\\\\n### Assignees\\\\n\\\\nNo one assigned\\\\n\\\\n### Labels\\\\n\\\\nNo labels\\\\n\\\\nNo labels\\\\n\\\\n### Type\\\\n\\\\nNo type\\\\n\\\\n### Projects\\\\n\\\\nNo projects\\\\n\\\\n### Milestone\\\\n\\\\nNo milestone\\\\n\\\\n### Relationships\\\\n\\\\nNone yet\\\\n\\\\n### Development\\\\n\\\\nCode with agent mode\\\\n\\\\nSelect code repository\\\\n\\\\nNo branches or pull requests\\\\n\\\\n### Participants\\\\n\\\\n[![@cpacker](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5475622?s=64&u=d5b68b5396a75cb55e2d45afae51e348bc1686c9&v=4)](https://github.com/cpacker)[![@T-ravis-H](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169403510?s=64&u=12ba200abbe61ad835b53b37346ca2bc69c14bf8&v=4)](https://github.com/T-ravis-H)\\\\n\\\\n## Issue actions\\\\n\\\\nUnable to create an agent in the ADE · Issue #2212 · letta-ai/letta\\\",\\n            \\\"metadata\\\": {\\n              \\\"hovercard-subject-tag\\\": \\\"issue:2730616748\\\",\\n              \\\"github-keyboard-shortcuts\\\": \\\"repository,issues,copilot\\\",\\n              \\\"ogImage\\\": \\\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/ca0c550ec6733d8c991e090e09e9e413b4f8271c62cf3f6829521d7b236677ac/letta-ai/letta/issues/2212\\\",\\n              \\\"route-action\\\": \\\"issue_layout\\\",\\n              \\\"browser-errors-url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/_private/browser/errors\\\",\\n              \\\"fb:app_id\\\": \\\"1401488693436528\\\",\\n              \\\"og:description\\\": \\\"Describe the bug from localhost:8283/agents ; click on the \\\\\\\"+ Create Agent\\\\\\\" button, The \\\\\\\"Create Agent\\\\\\\" modal pops up, make any changes you want (that are valid (i.e., the agent name must be 2 chara...\\\",\\n              \\\"apple-itunes-app\\\": \\\"app-id=1477376905, app-argument=https://github.com/_view_fragments/issues/show/letta-ai/letta/2212/issue_layout\\\",\\n              \\\"browser-stats-url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/_private/browser/stats\\\",\\n              \\\"twitter:title\\\": \\\"Unable to create an agent in the ADE · Issue #2212 · letta-ai/l