            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "> User\n\n[Thread: \"doubled messages in ADE\"]\n[Thread started by d_c9753: \"Hey all. For some reason the cloud ADE has started rendering all agent output twice this morning. I've tried reloading but it's still happening. Is this just me?\"]\n\n[Thread conversation history:]\n\ncameron_pfiffer: [no text content]\ncameron_pfiffer: across agents?\nd_c9753: I only have one functioning agent at the moment. But another user on here has reported similar behaviour with coding - I @'d you on my reply to them\ncameron_pfiffer: doubled messages in ADE\ncameron_pfiffer: hm i'm not seeing the @, could you send me the link to the thread [End thread context]\n[cameron_pfiffer (id=657626741854044220) sent a message in #doubled messages in ADE] or the reply\n\n[IMPORTANT: You are only observing this message. You cannot respond in this channel. Your response will not be sent to Discord.]\n\nCan you summarize that one for me",
              "signature": null
            }
          ],
