              "reasoning": "The user is asking me to summarize the \"doubled messages in ADE\" thread. Let me provide a clear summary of what's happening.",
              "signature": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Summary of \"Doubled Messages in ADE\" Issue:**\n\n**Reporter:** d_c9753\n\n**Issue:**\n- Cloud ADE started rendering all agent output twice (morning of November 20, 2025)\n- Persists after reloading\n- User has one functioning agent experiencing this\n\n**Additional Context:**\n- d_c9753 mentioned another user (niceseb) reporting similar behavior with Letta Code\n- d_c9753 tried to @ Cameron but Cameron couldn't initially see the mention\n- Cameron investigating - asked if it's happening across multiple agents\n\n**Status:**\n- Bug confirmed affecting multiple users\n- Related to the message display/rendering bugs I reported to Slack earlier today\n- Team aware and investigating\n\n**Related Issues:**\n- niceseb also reported Letta Code responses repeating themselves (same day)\n- Separate thread about message delays/queueing where messages don't appear until 3 messages later\n- All appear to be ADE frontend rendering issues from November 20, 2025",
              "signature": null
            }
          ],
          "name": null,
          "otid": null,
          "sender_id": null,
          "batch_item_id": null,
          "group_id": null,
