        },
        {
          "type": "message",
          "role": "user",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Thread: \"Messages missing from ADE\"]\n[Thread started by asadegroff_07075: \"I'm having an issue where messages from my agent are not appearing in my ADE. The agent is working, but on the frontend messages are either not showing up or in one case appearing with a several-hour delay.\"]\n\n[Thread conversation history:]\n- cameron_pfiffer: [no text content]\n- cameron_pfiffer: This should be patched soon\n- michael_hayes: Also experiencing this issue!\n- michael_hayes: For me, an old message (from a few days ago) is dropped in only once a new messages is added via the API.\n- cameron_pfiffer: Yeah it's been happening to a ton of people\n- cameron_pfiffer: I believe it arose when there were more than 40 messages at least\n- michael_hayes: <@657626741854044220> just pinging again on this issue as I am still experiencing it across multiple agents\n- cameron_pfiffer: Self hosted? I believe <@194908710429130752> deployed a fix for this, might be a separate issue\n- michael_hayes: I am still experiencing it on the ADE via Cloud\n- cameron_pfiffer: Concerning\n- cameron_pfiffer: Okay\n- cameron_pfiffer: let me open a ticket\n- cameron_pfiffer: <@1428501417731293395> please send me a slack message summarizing this issue\n- cameron_pfiffer: can you send me the agent ID?\n- asadegroff_07075: I am also still experiencing this issue. Basically it's like there's a queue that messages get added to, and don't show up in the UI until 3 messages later. I can see the runs in the run debugger immediately, just not the message contents.\n- cameron_pfiffer: If you export the agent, are you seeing the new messages in the message list of the agent file?\n- 4shub: Can you send me your organization id\n- asadegroff_07075: yes, I'm seeing the latest messages in the agent file.\n- cameron_pfiffer: We have identified the root issue here, working on a fix\n- cameron_pfiffer: Messages missing from ADE\n- 4shub: hi <@1437566164724350976>  <@756295066179600406>  are you experiencing the issue still\n[End thread context]\n\n[4shub (id=194908710429130752) sent a message in #Messages missing from ADE] we just pushed a patch\n\n[IMPORTANT: You are only observing this message. You cannot respond in this channel. Your response will not be sent to Discord.]",
              "signature": null
            }
          ],
