          "role": "user",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Recent conversation context:]\n- ayayronny_: ayy cloudfare is back\n- ayayronny_: again..\n- ayayronny_: meridianlabsapp.website\n- zhangc_666: Hey Letta fans! 👋\n\nI'm a huge believer in \"Stateful LLMs\". I built an open-source project called LifeContext that acts as a Long-term Memory Layer for your browser.\n\nInstead of managing memory for a chatbot, it manages memory for User Browsing History.\n\nIngestion: Incrementally scrapes DOM to build a timeline of context.\n\nRecall: Uses local vector search (ChromaDB) to retrieve past events.\n\nGoal: To solve the \"I saw it last week but forgot where\" problem.\n\nIt's a customized RAG implementation specifically for browsing data. Repo: https://github.com/LifeContext/lifecontext\n\nWould love to discuss memory retrieval strategies with you guys!\n- my_name_is_michael: Well done guys. 👏  There's a lot of contributors to this project so well done to all of you. What feature do you think will be the most popular?\n- cameron_pfiffer: yo this is sick\n[End context]\n\n[vedant_0200 (id=853227126648078347) sent a message in #🎁｜showcase] https://github.com/Vedant020000/promptex\n\n[IMPORTANT: You are only observing this message. You cannot respond in this channel. Your response will not be sent to Discord.]",
