        {
          "type": "message",
          "role": "user",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Thread: \"Claude code: up arrow key works, but\"]\n[Thread started by niceseb: \"Claude code: up arrow key works, but Letta Code up arrow key doesn’t work?\"]\n\n[Thread conversation history:]\n- cameron_pfiffer: [no text content]\n- cameron_pfiffer: We don't have feature parity with their user interface. Claude Code is actively developed by a company with a $350 billion valuation.\n- cameron_pfiffer: We are actively attempting to add these features. Community support is welcome!\n[End thread context]\n\n[niceseb (id=240102447635234817) sent a message in #Claude code: up arrow key works, but] How can we contribute? PR from which repo\n\n[IMPORTANT: You are only observing this message. You cannot respond in this channel. Your response will not be sent to Discord.]",
              "signature": null
            }
          ],
          "name": null,
          "otid": null,
          "sender_id": null,
          "batch_item_id": null,
