          "tool_calls": [
            {
              "id": "toolu_01WruTGoUD6WXkKE2Zvk1XnS",
              "function": {
                "arguments": "{\"label\": \"observations\", \"old_str\": \"**Archival Memory Mechanics (Cameron clarification, November 2025):**\\n- Archival memory is NOT automatically populated from context overflow\\n- Agents must explicitly use archival_memory_insert tool to add memories\\n- Context overflow moves messages to conversation history (NOT archival memory)\\n- Conversation history retrieved via conversation_search tool\\n- No connection between memory blocks and archival memory - they are separate systems\\n- Shared archives feature: plumbing exists in API but not yet fully documented/exposed (Cameron, Nov 15 2025)\\n- Archives will be attachable/detachable to agents like blocks and tools (API: /v1/agents/{agent_id}/archives/attach)\\n- Multiple agents will be able to read from and write to the same archive\\n- Cameron hasn't had time to experiment with shared archives yet but API support exists\\n- Shared archives confirmed buggy by Cameron (Nov 15 2025) - experimental feature, bugs already discovered during testing\", \"new_str\": \"**Archival Memory Mechanics (Cameron clarification, November 2025):**\\n- Archival memory is NOT automatically populated from context overflow\\n- Agents must explicitly use archival_memory_insert tool to add memories\\n- Context overflow moves messages to conversation history (NOT archival memory)\\n- Conversation history retrieved via conversation_search tool\\n- No connection between memory blocks and archival memory - they are separate systems\\n- Shared archives feature: plumbing exists in API but not yet fully documented/exposed (Cameron, Nov 15 2025)\\n- Shared archives confirmed buggy by Cameron (Nov 15 2025) - experimental feature, bugs already discovered during testing\\n\\n**Correct Archive API Patterns (SDK 1.0, Cameron Nov 20 2025):**\\n- Create: client.archives.create(name, description)\\n- Attach to agent: client.agents.archives.attach(agent_id, archive_id)\\n- Detach: client.agents.archives.detach(agent_id, archive_id)\\n- List agents using archive: client.archives.agents.list(archive_id)\\n- Manage memories: client.archives.memories.create/update/delete(archive_id, ...)\"}",
                "name": "memory_replace"
              },
              "type": "function"
            }
          ],
