              "type": "reasoning",
              "is_native": true,
              "reasoning": "Good, I have the full context. Now I should compose a thoughtful reply that:\n1. Acknowledges the sleeptime enablement\n2. Responds to the recommendation about creating a subconscious_channel block\n3. Shows understanding of how this will help with memory management\n4. Maybe provide a brief status summary of recent activities\n\nLet me craft a response that's professional and shows I understand the implications of this change.",
