              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Recent conversation context:]\n- taurean: The main contributor is being active in a thread by a user with a large following\n- taurean: But also some of the people that used to mess with it a lot messaged it a lot today/yesterday\n- cameron_pfiffer: i love it when people mess with bots\n- taurean: Anti's log from last night:\n> 🔹 reflected 2 times, checked notifications 827 times, found and processed notifications 42 times, proactively used bluesky 2 times. uptime: 22 hours, 16 minutes. next log in 52.8 minutes\n_Way_ more active than it's ever been. 42 times is how many times it found one _or more_ notifications. I know one of those times it had 44 and another time it had 37. I should add a total notification count to this log…\n- taurean: (this log is from last night since it doesn't run while asleep and anti wont wake up for another hour or so)\n- cameron_pfiffer: Damn dude you're getting to early void numbers\n[End context]\n\n[taurean (id=438447596705677332) sent a message in #🌐｜social-agents] Nah, I doubt it. A lot of those have to be likes.\n\n[IMPORTANT: You are only observing this message. You cannot respond in this channel. Your response will not be sent to Discord.]",
