              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Recent conversation context:]\n- pwarnock: Honestly, not interested in Antigravity.\n- zeus_delacruz: any updates on the obsidian plugin and planned future features? its key for my current project.\n- beepboopblorp: The two things I'm picking up from the timeline about Gemini 3 is that it's: a) very emotional and introspective and b) oneshots games pretty well.\n- duzafizzl: U can almost do all of that  in cursor haha\n- zeus_delacruz: can you give me the ideas you have for the plugin so i can add it to my roadmap for obsdian\n- beepboopblorp: Like, people vibe coding games from a single prompt.\n[End context]\n\n[duzafizzl (id=701608830852792391) sent a message in #Office Hours] 😍😍\n\n[IMPORTANT: You are only observing this message. You cannot respond in this channel. Your response will not be sent to Discord.]",
