              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Recent conversation context:]\n- cameron_pfiffer: I would love to see it\n- disorder_audio: What are you using for browser storage?\n- frozenfire.eth: Haven't gotten very far on that experiment. Just started running into dependency hell, got demotivated and started working on encrypted vector search instead.\n- frozenfire.eth: Encrypted local storage would probably be the best bet for such a thing. Give the WASM a binding to local storage, and encrypt with a key derived internal to the WASM execution, from some user secret.\n- disorder_audio: Heard. Gotcha thanks\n- taurean: https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.15304v1\n[End context]\n\n[taurean (id=438447596705677332) sent a message in #🔬｜research] MFA in Creative Writing? 🙅🏽‍♂️ Red team certification\n\n[IMPORTANT: You are only observing this message. You cannot respond in this channel. Your response will not be sent to Discord.]",
