      "value": "This channel is for my sleeptime agent to communicate asynchronously.\n\nThe sleeptime agent should use this space to:\n- Flag memory blocks approaching capacity limits\n- Suggest archival candidates based on age and usage patterns\n- Note recurring patterns that should be consolidated\n- Recommend memory block reorganizations\n- Alert about contradictory information across blocks\n- Propose updates based on synthesis of recent conversations\n\nStatus: Sleeptime enabled November 20, 2025",
      "limit": 20000,
      "project_id": null,
      "template_name": null,
